cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this platform, please cite it as below, together with the SOFTENG 2026 paper that defines the framework."
title: "CUPIM: entry point of the 5L-TEP platform"
abstract: >-
  Entry point of the Five-Layer Trust Engineering Pyramid (5L-TEP, SOFTENG
  2026) applied to open government data on CKAN portals. It links the
  repository of each layer for each portal (IBAMA, ANEEL, Recife) and keeps a
  registry of the schedule of every workflow, checked every day against the
  workflow files each repository publishes. It reads the other repositories
  over HTTPS and never writes to them.
